      "kind": "text",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 200,
      "w": 200,
      "h": 162,
      "text": "Everyone blamed my purple Game Boy. Then Kit switched seats and the bad button followed HIM. We wrote up the test so the next club can settle it in one recess.",
