        {
          "id": "b2bd4cb529794cfeacc6caffa0cf9a79",
          "kind": "text",
          "x": 22,
          "y": 125,
          "w": 600,
          "h": 28,
          "text": "TEST A   /   Keep your seats",
          "src": "",
          "href": "",
          "color": "#9e2936",
          "fill": "",
          "font_family": "Arial",
          "font_size": 20,
          "bold": true,
          "italic": false,
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "id": "6319180c3245495a83b2097c13342177",
          "kind": "text",
          "x": 22,
          "y": 157,
          "w": 596,
          "h": 65,
          "text": "Two Game Boys. Two copies of Tetris. One cable. We marked one plug with red tape so we could tell which end was which.",
          "src": "",
          "href": "",
          "color": "#252333",
          "fill": "",
          "font_family": "Verdana",
          "font_size": 17,
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false,
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "id": "95858a580645406b88c188fb257703d3",
          "kind": "text",
          "x": 22,
          "y": 227,
          "w": 600,
          "h": 28,
          "text": "TEST B   /   Swap one thing",
          "src": "",
          "href": "",
          "color": "#9e2936",
          "fill": "",
          "font_family": "Arial",
          "font_size": 20,
          "bold": true,
          "italic": false,
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "id": "f01a9ab4aa624daea29c7ef4bbc97afc",
          "kind": "text",
          "x": 22,
          "y": 259,
          "w": 596,
          "h": 65,
          "text": "Jo took Kit's seat but kept her handheld. The missed turns stayed with Kit's machine. The cable was off the suspect list.",
          "src": "",
          "href": "",
          "color": "#252333",
          "fill": "",
          "font_family": "Verdana",
          "font_size": 17,
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false,
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "id": "10aa9150f6344f64b6981c614830ebbf",
          "kind": "text",
          "x": 22,
          "y": 330,
          "w": 600,
          "h": 28,
          "text": "VERDICT   /   The lunch crumb",
          "src": "",
          "href": "",
          "color": "#9e2936",
          "fill": "",
          "font_family": "Arial",
          "font_size": 20,
          "bold": true,
          "italic": false,
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "id": "ed2451605a8b44f2948bc5c4376fa203",
          "kind": "text",
          "x": 22,
          "y": 362,
          "w": 596,
          "h": 65,
          "text": "A cracker crumb was sitting on the left side of Kit's D-pad. Brushed it away, played three clean rounds. Repairs charged: one cracker.",
          "src": "",
          "href": "",
          "color": "#252333",
          "fill": "",
          "font_family": "Verdana",
          "font_size": 17,
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false,
          "align": "left"
        },
